  "goodToKnow": "Abführen means to lead away, typically by police: in Handschellen abgeführt. In finance, it means to pay over money one has collected: Steuern, Sozialabgaben ans Finanzamt abführen; employers abführen wage tax directly. In medicine, abführend means laxative, and das Abführmittel is a laxative: Pflaumen wirken abführend. Separable: führte ab, abgeführt."
